# Outputs of the skeleton benchmark harness (now in the private scripts repo), which
# older checkouts still hold here. skel_compare_out/ was committed once (35 files,
# 81 MB) because nothing ignored it; benchmark masks are ~450 MB each.
views/
*_3d.html
skel_compare_out/
skel_benchmark_out/
