# Site-specific dask configs and dataset allowlists live here, untracked. The
# LEADING SLASH is load-bearing: a bare `configs/` matches at any depth and would
# also swallow neu_morpho/configs/, so the bundled configs would silently never
# be committed and the installed command would ship without the data it resolves.
/configs/
